OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FPro chef Stephen hosts the week's
OL,7,     Fthird visit at The Crossings Inn
OL,8,     Fin Cumbria. His ethos is
OL,9,     Fno-nonsense accommodation and
OL,10,     Fgorgeous grub, so eggs-pectations
OL,11,     Fare sky high at breakfast time.
OL,12,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe week's last visit is to Jane's
OL,14,     Flovingly restored Plas Maenan
OL,15,     FCountry House in Wales' Conwy
OL,16,     FValley. But the restoration
OL,17,     Fdoesn't meet everyone's standards
OL,18,     Fwith patchy paintwork a problem.
